  "title": "Capture: Fix second and future stats open (sparklines) on Windows",
  "description": "We create the dummy signal pipe only allowing one instance, so close\nthe handle when we're done with it (and set it to NULL, so we'll\ncreate another one.)\n\nIf creating the dummy signal pipe fails, return failure and set the\nerror message.\n\nLog error messages on failure of capture_stat_start()\n\nFix #15470",
